veshell: Veshell is a Wayland compositor built with Rust (smithay) and a
veshell: Flutter shell. Instead of stacking windows it lays applications out
veshell: in a two-dimensional space you navigate with directional keys,
veshell: leaning on spatial memory rather than taskbars and alt-tab.
veshell:
veshell: This is a work-in-progress fork of an upstream project that has been
veshell: dormant for about a year. Start a session from a text console with
veshell: veshell-session. See NEWS.txt for what works and what does not.
